<!--
	The small icon on the "sharing your location" foreground-service notification.

	Its own drawable rather than a stock android.R one: the stock set is not guaranteed across
	API levels or OEM skins, and a missing small icon makes the notification fail to post at
	all - which on this app means the foreground service cannot start and a ride silently
	never begins.

	A silhouette, white on transparent. From Android 5 the system masks a notification's small
	icon to its alpha channel and tints it, so anything with colour in it arrives as a white
	blob. This is a location crosshair: a ring, a centre dot and four ticks, which reads at
	24 dp in a status bar next to the clock.
-->
